  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Hey there! Here's a little bit about our brand and products!!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different: </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Our brand mixes that RELATABLE feeling of wanting to talk to someone about our problems ALL the time! Friends and family have told me that I needed to go to therapy to solve my issues..So I did and my therapist said that I was actually extremely self aware and doing fine! Whenever she asked me how I dealt with my emotions I would tell her that I<br>listened to music.. BEATS if you will! After a while, a friend of mine who came to the rescue and finally took some time to learn and understand me gave me the lightbulb that I had been longing to find for a while. I loved comfy clothing when I'm healing, I love listening to music when I'm healing and I've overcame the mental battle I had struggled with alone. You no longer have to feel alone! We are all here to support each other the best way we can!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Affiliates can earn by:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">1.  sharing their affiliate link with friends and family</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">2. Sharing our product on social media</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">3. Creating content in/with our brand!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">You can promote us anywhere as long as you're using YOUR link!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Other information:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">- Commission: 15%</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">- Discount codes available after making 10 sales!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">- Free shipping available after 5 sales!</p></div></div>",
